---
source: apps/whether/tests/cli.rs
expression: text(&out.stdout)
---
tui      interactive  interactive dashboard for terminals
gui      interactive  desktop window (Mousam-inspired), compact mode and kiosk
line     prints       one line of text, or waybar JSON, for status bars
json     prints       the view model or raw snapshot as JSON, for scripts
exec:*   external     external plugins from [display.exec.<name>] (JSON Lines over stdio)
